src/
├── layer1/   — Teensy 4.0 — light ring sensing + line detection
│               Reads 32 LDR sensors via MUX, runs findLine(), transmits
│               results (lineDetected, angle, size) to layer2 over Serial1→Serial4.
│               Libraries: light_ring, angle_utils, serial_comm
│
├── layer2/   — Teensy 4.0 — strategy + locomotion
│               Main brain: state machine (ORBIT, IR CHASE, SCORING, RTC, IDLE,
│               LINE DETECTED), X-drive motor control, BNO085 IMU heading-hold PID,
│               camera-based localisation (dual-goal triangulation), dribbler/kicker.
│               Receives: L1 via Serial4, L3 via Serial5, camera via Serial3.
│               Libraries: movement, scoring, cam_comm, layer1_comm, layer3_comm,
│                          serial_comm, angle_utils
│
└── layer3/   — Seeed XIAO ESP32-C3 — IR ball detection + DIP switches
                Polls 28-IR sensor ring, clusters readings to find ball angle,
                reads 4 DIP switches (goal colour, role, strat0, strat1).
                Sends ball angle + switch states to layer2 over Serial1→Serial5.
                Libraries: serial_comm
